{"name":"Craft Brown","hex":"#b7a083","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"craft","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Strength; power; might; force .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}.","Intellectual power; skill; art."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To make by hand and with much skill.","To construct, develop something (like a skilled craftsman)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/craft"},{"term":"brown","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A colour like that of chocolate or coffee.","One of the colour balls used in snooker, with a value of 4 points."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having a brown color/colour.","Gloomy."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/brown"}],"entries":[{"title":"Craft","blocks":[{"text":"A craft or trade is a pastime or an occupation that requires particular skills and knowledge of skilled work. In a historical sense, particularly the Middle Ages and earlier, the term is usually applied to people occupied in small scale production of goods, or their maintenance, for example by tinkers. The traditional term craftsman is nowadays often replaced by artisan and by craftsperson."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Craft_fair_and_folk_festival_Bangladesh_2024_at_Sonargaon_museum_35.jpg/330px-Craft_fair_and_folk_festival_Bangladesh_2024_at_Sonargaon_museum_35.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Craft","wikidata":"Q2207288"},{"title":"Brown","blocks":[{"text":"Brown is a color. It can be thought as a darker, typically desaturated shade of orange, and can often be produced by combining red and yellow with another color, namely blue."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Espresso-roasted_coffee_beans.jpg/330px-Espresso-roasted_coffee_beans.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.